@startuml deadline_time_flow
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
' deadline_time_flow — how a deadline TIME travels through the layers (v22).
' Converted from Mermaid in the v26.8 audit (never rendered until now).
'
' Read it as ONE FACT crossing five boundaries. The thing to notice is where
' the pairing invariant lives: "a time needs a date" is enforced at the
' DOMAIN door — AppData — and nowhere else. Four capture surfaces, one rule.
' Had the rule lived in the widgets, adding the LLM path in v21.2 would have
' meant re-implementing it a fourth time, and the fourth copy is always the
' one that gets it wrong.
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!include _style.puml

title A deadline time, from four keyboards to five consumers

package "Capture — four ways in" {
  component "Quick-add text\n«lab 4 friday 17:00»" as qa
  component "TaskDetailDialog\nQTimeEdit + «All day»" as dlg
  component "DueDateDialog\ncalendar + time row" as due
  component "LLM reply\ndue_time: «HH:MM»" as llm
}

component "ParsedTask\n{dueDate, dueTime}" as pt
component "quickAddPreviewHtml\n(shows it BEFORE commit)" as prev

qa --> pt : nlp::parseQuickAdd
llm --> pt : llm::fromJsonObject
pt --> prev

package "Domain — the only place the invariant lives" {
  database "AppData::addTask\nsetTaskDueDate · updateTask" as door
  component "dueDate valid?" as inv
  component "Task{dueDate, dueTime}" as task
  door --> inv
  inv --> task : yes
  inv --> task : no — drop the orphan time
}

prev --> door
dlg --> door : chosenDueDate / chosenDueTime
due --> door : chosenDate / chosenTime

component "TaskListModel · CategoryTaskModel\nDueTimeRole" as models
database "JsonStore\n«dueTime»: ISO or «»" as json
component "coverage::needsBlock\n(one clock-aware branch)" as cov
component "TaskFilterProxy::lessThan\nsame day → earliest clock first" as proxy
component "TaskCardDelegate\n«due 17:00»" as cards
component "CategoryTaskDelegate\n«Aug 8 · 17:00»" as pills
component "NeedsBlockCard\n«Fri 24 Jul 17:00 · in 3d»" as nbc
component "sync + share\nfree ride on the wire" as wire

task --> models : changed()
task --> json
task --> cov
models --> proxy
proxy --> cards
models --> pills
cov --> nbc
json ..> wire : the field costs the wire nothing extra

note bottom of inv
  <b>An orphan time is dropped, not stored.</b>
  "17:00, no date" is not a deadline, it is a
  half-typed one — and storing it would force
  every consumer downstream to invent its own
  answer for what to paint.
end note
@enduml
